  "title": "Breakout! Thank the “Fab Four”",
  "summary": "It’s become quite clear that the S&P 500 (SPX) is breaking out to a new high today after flirting with one yesterday. Furthermore, it’s quite clear that the strategy of buying a breakout is quite popular today, since stocks have barely bothered to take a breather in their relentless advance. As wonderful as that is for most investors, it behooves us to consider why SPX is up over 5% in fewer than four sessions. Some of that is clearly related to [yet another round of] hopes for a resolution in the Persian Gulf, but that’s not the only factor. I give the “Fab Four” plenty of credit.",
